>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `field_ss`

``` hol4
seedCollections.field_ss : unit -> simpLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Returns an ssfrag containing the ancestry-backed `field_simps` collection.
It includes the algebra collection's concrete rearrangement rules plus real
and rational division-elimination rules.  It is never added to a default
simpset.

### See also

[`seedCollections.algebra_ss`](#seedCollections.algebra_ss),
[`seedCollections.remove_field_simps`](#seedCollections.remove_field_simps)
